From: "nonggia.liang" <nonggia@192.168.0.101>
Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 09:37:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] feat(catalog-lakehouse-cust): add DDL/namespace/view
 rules
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implement spec §5.3 DDL and namespace routing overrides on
CustIcebergCatalog:

- createTable: reject if table exists locally or upstream
- dropTable: reject unmaterialized mirror; purge scoped to local
- renameTable: reject unmaterialized mirror
- listNamespaces: union of local and upstream
- loadNamespaceMetadata: virtual empty props for upstream-only
- dropNamespace: reject upstream-only virtual namespace

Views require no override (inherited ViewCatalog from JdbcCatalog is
already local-only). Add TestCustDdl with 9 tests covering all 5
spec-mandated scenarios. All 45 module tests pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
