+   * ForbiddenException} — dropping an unmaterialized mirror is not meaningful since the catalog-a
+   * side has nothing to drop. If the table exists neither locally nor upstream, {@link
+   * NoSuchTableException} propagates from the underlying JdbcCatalog.
+   *
